<title>UK: Commerzbank set warrants on 6.25 pct Bund due 2024.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank set warrants on 6.25 pct Bund due 2024.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank said it has issued 80 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the 6.25 pct Bund due 2024.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.JUN.97-30.JUN.98   PAYDATE	10.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     RATIO	  1/1</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p>WARRANT	    STRIKE	 PRICE</p>
<p>CALL		 93.0 PCT     2.87 DEM</p>
<p>CALL		 95.0 PCT     1.98 DEM</p>
<p>CALL		 97.0 PCT     1.34 DEM</p>
<p>CALL		 99.0 PCT     0.87 DEM</p>
<p>PUT		  89.0 PCT     2.67 DEM</p>
<p>PUT		  91.0 PCT     3.48 DEM</p>
<p>PUT		  93.0 PCT     4.57 DEM</p>
<p>PUT		  95.0 PCT     5.71 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
